wait-for Search the web
tap-id samples
wait-for samples.browse.invalid
tap-id browser-more
tap-id navigate
tap-id page-view
tap-at 350 378
wait-for samples.browse.invalid/…
tap-id browser-more
tap-id navigate
tap-id page-view
wait-for 1 of 3
shot-colour scroll-before
input pointer down 700 1000
input pointer move 700 700
input pointer up 700 500
shot-colour scroll-after
tap-id edit-address
shot-colour scroll-keyboard
tap-id kb.cancel
